  "description": "<p>If you create properties on a resource using an unregistered namespace the HTML UI for fedora 4 will forever present an automatically generated namespace prefix.  </p>\n\n<p>To improve this experience for migrated data, either allow the migration utility to specify namespace prefix mappings that will be assigned, or perhaps use the namespace prefix specified in the RELS-EXT or RELS-INT you're importing... or both. </p>",
